<p>The <strong class="selflink">effect_regeneration 2da</strong> defines <sup>[<a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Category%20-%20Articles%20with%20documentation%20requests" title="Category:Articles with documentation requests">Undocumented</a>]</sup>
</p><p>The <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/2DA" title="2da">2da</a> is defined as an <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/M2da" title="M2da (page does not exist)">m2da</a> in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/M2DA%20base%202da" title="M2DA base 2da">M2DA_base 2da</a> and has an <b>ID</b> of <b>173</b>. It can be extended by m2da fragments which have names starting with <b>effect_regeneration</b>. It can be referenced in scripting using the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/TABLE" title="TABLE *">TABLE_EFFECT_REGENERATION</a> constant defined in <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/2da%20constants%20h" title="2da constants h">2da_constants_h</a>. 
</p>
